<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav April oil output falls to 81,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav April oil output falls to 81,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>					 APRIL	MARCH    APRIL 1996</p>
<p> crude petroleum (tonnes)     81,000     83,000	84,000</p>
<p> natural gas (mln cu.meters)     50	   54	    54</p>
<p>-- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom +381 11 311 4305</p>
